        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Horton Foote, Malcolm Brogdon\n- Works: Hurry Sundown, Infinite Jest, Hamlet\n- Roles: Screenwriters, Playwrights, Authors, Musicians\n\nFacts:\n- Horton Foote wrote the screenplay for the film *Hurry Sundown*.\n- *Infinite Jest* is an album by Malcolm Brogdon.\n- The title *Infinite Jest* was taken from a line in William Shakespeare's *Hamlet*.\n- Horton Foote and Malcolm Brogdon are not both playwrights.",
